<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>决策 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</title><link>https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96/</link><description>Recent content in 决策 on Yousa Driven Development | YDD</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.148.1</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:53:02 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yousali.com/tags/%E5%86%B3%E7%AD%96/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>用 AI 做决策：先写自己的判断，再请它挑错</title><link>https://yousali.com/kb/ai-decision-critique/</link><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/kb/ai-decision-critique/</guid><description>让 AI 比较选项，自己说明如何取舍，再让 AI 检查关键假设。附两个可复制的提示词和三道练习。</description></item><item><title>不知道结果时怎么选，出了结果怎么评</title><link>https://yousali.com/kb/decision-making-under-uncertainty/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/kb/decision-making-under-uncertainty/</guid><description>用市集试摊和每月固定租金的铺面两个假设画面，说明退路和证据要分开看，试错够便宜才值得试，方法要能让结果改变下一步。</description></item><item><title>选工作，你在看朋友圈还是体检报告？</title><link>https://yousali.com/posts/20260214-choose-leader-signal-vs-system/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Feb 2026 12:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yousali.com/posts/20260214-choose-leader-signal-vs-system/</guid><description>「跟对人」没有错，但「对的人」不是一眼看上去让你兴奋的人，而是经得起去光环化检验的人</description></item></channel></rss>